invariant: INV-17
file: rsa_sign64.c
catches: rsa_sign_equiv_test
reason: rsa_sign64_sp1 returns without wiping the words it read the
  encoded message into, which rsa_pss_sign wipes as bytes when the
  private operation returns. bin/rsa_sign_equiv_test copies the stack
  below one call and finds two words of the encoded message there.

--- old
    ct_wipe(&mod_q, sizeof mod_q);
    ct_wipe(em_plain, sizeof em_plain);
--- new
    ct_wipe(&mod_q, sizeof mod_q);
